<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "This module contains terms and relations necessary for representing process intermediate and product quality attributes, process indicators and process parameters." .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Adlane Rebai, Millipore Sigma" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Ana Nikolov, OAGi" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Boonserm Kulvatunyou, NIST" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Cameron Gibbs, CrownPoint Technologies, LLC" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Gabriela Henning, NIST" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Jan Kemper, AstraZeneca" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Marie-Aude Coutouly, Millipore Sigma" .
