<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Biopharma Parameter Ontology"@en-US .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/202603/biopharma/BiopharmaMaterial/> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/202603/biopharma/ReferenceOntologyCandidates/> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/202603/biopharma/TargetsLimitsRanges/> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/202603/core/Core/> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/202603/biopharma/BiopharmaParameter/> .
